=== 1. does any surface emit invalid_interval? ===
  REST, unsupported interval:
    interval=3m     400 name=invalid_param header=invalid_param
    interval=1w     400 name=invalid_param header=invalid_param
    interval=bogus  400 name=invalid_param header=invalid_param
  WS ohlcv, unsupported timeframe (correct singular shape):
    timeframe=3m     -> subscription_failed | {"type":"error","errorName":"subscription_failed","message":"subscription failed to channel: ohlcv"}
    timeframe=1w     -> subscription_failed | {"type":"error","errorName":"subscription_failed","message":"subscription failed to channel: ohlcv"}
    timeframe=(omitted) -> subscription_failed | {"type":"error","errorName":"subscription_failed","message":"subscription failed to channel: ohlcv"}

